      "name": "POWER GRADATION",
      "text": "Follow-up skill: Carves a seven-pointed star more quickly, dealing damage and slowing enemies. Gains crowd control immunity and damage reduction while the skill is active. When the star is formed, deals extra damage and launches enemies in the center."
